  "details": "Description\n\nI'm not sure if this is a meta issue, but whever i'm in a call and try to talk in app, my mic makes a nonstop buzzing sound. it only happens when i'm in cacall, but it works fine in other apps.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nnot sure it just kind of started. it still happens after leaving the ptc and open beta, and still after a factory reset.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Audio\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p1-1937-299983b13b-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-07_20-29-08.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_9064b34d-9ed2-48f0-95d2-cfe45b290185/1/file)",
